graph TD
    A[RGB Images + Edge Masks] --> B[EdgeMaskDataset<br/>resize 518x518, binarize]
    B --> C[DataLoader<br/>DistributedSampler, batch=4]

    C --> D[StudentEdgeMask.forward<br/>training mode]
    D --> E[logits + ds1_logits + ds2_logits]

    E --> F[EdgeLoss]
    F --> F1[BCE Loss × 0.5]
    F --> F2[Dice Loss × 0.5]
    F1 --> F3[Weighted Sum<br/>final=1.0, ds1=0.1, ds2=0.2]
    F2 --> F3

    F3 --> G[loss.backward]
    G --> H[clip_grad_norm<br/>max_norm=1.0]
    H --> I[optimizer.step<br/>AdamW]
    I --> J[scheduler.step<br/>Warmup + Cosine]

    J --> K{End of Epoch?}
    K -->|No| C
    K -->|Yes| L[Validate<br/>Precision, Recall, F1, IoU]

    L --> M{F1 improved?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Save Best Checkpoint<br/>Reset Patience]
    M -->|No| O[Increment Patience]
    O --> P{Patience >= 15?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Early Stop]
    P -->|No| R[Save Last Checkpoint]
    N --> R
    R --> S{Epoch 100?}
    S -->|No| C
    S -->|Yes| T[Final Evaluation<br/>BF1, ODS, Dice]
    Q --> T
